          "type": "ForAnyElementType&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Moves the state of another allocator into this one.\nAssumes that the allocator is currently empty, i.e. memory may be allocated but any existing elements have already been destructed (if necessary).\n@param Other - The allocator to move the state from.  This allocator should be left in a valid empty state."
